# Fable review 2026-08-02 (F9). Without this, every Linux-side checkout of this repo — CI, a
# fresh clone, the Cowork device VM — reports all ~120 text files as modified, because they were
# committed with CRLF while core.autocrlf hides it on the authoring PC. That phantom diff is not
# cosmetic: it is what made an 08-02 session run git against the tree and strand a .git/index.lock.
# A real change should be the only thing that ever shows up in git status.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
